 	  Say Y here to add some extra checks and diagnostics to PINCTRL calls.
 
+config PINCTRL_AMB
+	bool "Ambarella pin controller support"
+	depends on ARCH_AMBARELLA || COMPILE_TEST
+	select GENERIC_PINCONF
